       SSMM22 signatures can be generated by using  the  ’DigestSign’  series  of
       APIs,  for  instance,  EEVVPP__DDiiggeessttSSiiggnnIInniitt(()), EEVVPP__DDiiggeessttSSiiggnnUUppddaattee(()) and
       EEVVPP__DDiiggeessttSSiiggnnFFiinnaall(()).  Ditto for the verification process  by  calling
       the ’DigestVerify’ series of APIs.

       Before computing an SSMM22 signature, an EEVVPP__PPKKEEYY__CCTTXX needs to be created,
       and an SSMM22 ID must be set for it, like this:

        EVP_PKEY_CTX_set1_id(pctx, id, id_len);

       Before   calling  the  EEVVPP__DDiiggeessttSSiiggnnIInniitt(())  or  EEVVPP__DDiiggeessttVVeerriiffyyIInniitt(())
       functions, that EEVVPP__PPKKEEYY__CCTTXX should be assigned to the EEVVPP__MMDD__CCTTXX, like
       this:

